<title>MALAYSIA: Public Finance year net rises 21.2 pct.</title>
<headline>Public Finance year net rises 21.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit	 109.03   vs	  89.99</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	 39.0    vs	  36.0</p>
<p>    Turnover		   776.49   vs	 596.93</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   162.03   vs	 133.69</p>
<p>    Minorities		    -     vs	    -</p>
<p>    Dividend   (cents)	12.0    vs	  16.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Malaysia's Public Finance Bhd is a finance company.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
</text>
